            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Devkitty 1.0.0 (build 305)</h2>
<p>Changes since build 304.</p>
<h3>Build 305: Smarter browser suggestions</h3>
<ul>
<li>Address bar and Cmd+P suggestions are sorted like Firefox and Chrome: recent and frequent sites first, with a small boost for bookmarks. Bookmarks no longer always come first.</li>
<li>Typing a site&#x27;s exact address always puts that site first.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
